  "title": "Simple Steamed Artichokes Recipe",
  "description": "This simple steamed artichoke recipe cooks in water with garlic, bay leaf, and lemon juice for a light, healthy, and delicious vegetarian appetizer.",
  "authors": [
    "Kelly"
  ],
